+golconda-exhausted | 1830 | Hyderabad | trade, work | deccan | Golconda diamonds | The Golconda mines run out | Golconda diamonds were mined in the Godavari–Krishna delta region, and Golconda Fort became an important centre of the diamond trade. After centuries of mining, production was exhausted by 1830. | For hundreds of years famous diamonds came from the mines of Golconda. By 1830 there were none left to find.
